<title>JAPAN: Namco to buy back up to 120,000 of its shares.</title>
<headline>Namco to buy back up to 120,000 of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Namco Ltd, a leading computer game software and equipment maker, said on Thursday that it had decided to buy back up to 120,000 shares and was willing for spend up to 720 million yen doing so.</p>
<p>Namco said it would repurchase the shares to introduce a stock option scheme.</p>
</text>
